		)
		(uuid "0b290522-3710-4bfe-bc5a-834d20efccec")
	)
	(text "USB-C (phone): phone is the USB host. CC1/CC2 go to the STM32 UCPD (PB6/PB4): Rd by default,\nPD power-role swap lets the robot charge the phone while it stays host. Q7101 blocks the phone's\nVBUS from back-feeding the robot 5 V (the TMI6240 body diode conducts VOUT->VIN); PWR_EN turns\non TMI6240 and Q7101 together. TMI6240 now runs from VCC-5V-REG (U25 buck removed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.99 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "31e8f042-5a87-4f6b-86db-ed454a245453")
	)
	(text "configured as 4S"
