	(text "DC_IN: 20 V brick or dock. With the battery disconnected (Q14 off) BAT-VCC = DC_IN - 0.4 V,\nso the SLM6900 (95% max duty) needs >= ~18.5 V to finish a 4S charge. Keep DC_IN <= 22 V (D7301, Q13 Vgs)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
